<title>GREECE: OTE LEASING RELOCATES TO ATHENS CENTRE, PLANS BRANCHES.</title>
<headline>OTE LEASING RELOCATES TO ATHENS CENTRE, PLANS BRANCHES.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>OTE telecom subsidiary OTE Leasing has relocated to Stadiou 15 in OTE's neoclassical building near the old parliament in the Athens centre, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>The leasing company, which started operations with a share capital of 6.0 billion drachmas in early 1997, plans a network of branches in northern Greece and Thessaloniki, along OTE's operating telecom stores, it said. --George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
